<i>♪ How am I meant to survive</i>
<i>When you look this beautiful? ♪</i>

553
00:40:17,806 --> 00:40:19,686
Did his work become more
important than Bharathi?

554
00:40:20,486 --> 00:40:21,566
He'll show up tomorrow, won't he?

555
00:40:22,206 --> 00:40:23,086
I'll deal with him then.

556
00:40:40,406 --> 00:40:41,366
Hey, stop.

557
00:40:43,006 --> 00:40:44,326
If you get caught,
you're dead meat!

558
00:40:44,366 --> 00:40:45,486
- Come on!
- Oh God!

559
00:40:47,686 --> 00:40:48,566
What happened?

560
00:40:49,086 --> 00:40:51,486
Tulasi's men from Kotthacheruvu
took a woman away,

561
00:40:53,606 --> 00:40:55,086
You won't return if you go there.

562
00:41:08,366 --> 00:41:09,446
Nothing, girl.

563
00:41:10,886 --> 00:41:12,366
I heard you're an expert at playing games.

564
00:41:19,486 --> 00:41:21,366
I've set up this little contest
at my town square!

565
00:41:23,286 --> 00:41:24,646
It's not a card game this time.

566
00:41:25,766 --> 00:41:27,206
It's a different kind of game!

567
00:41:44,966 --> 00:41:46,446
I just can't resist you.

568
00:43:36,446 --> 00:43:37,286
Get him, boys!

569
00:43:37,326 --> 00:43:39,006
Don't let him
leave this town square alive.

570
00:44:05,366 --> 00:44:06,246
Vasanth?

571
00:44:24,686 --> 00:44:27,286
- I'll kill you! Stay away.
- Stop! You'll kill him!

572
00:44:27,366 --> 00:44:28,206
Let's go.

573
00:44:28,246 --> 00:44:29,286
- I'll kill you.
- Let's go.

574
00:44:35,286 --> 00:44:36,206
Vasanth.

575
00:44:36,286 --> 00:44:38,326
I was a hungry orphan
when I came to <i>Bharatam Mitta.</i>

576
00:44:38,726 --> 00:44:39,606
He fed me.

577
00:44:39,686 --> 00:44:43,646
<i>♪ Once upon a time, who would've known? ♪</i>

578
00:44:44,086 --> 00:44:50,086
<i>♪ A little heart longed</i>
<i>For a love to call its own… ♪</i>

579
00:44:50,326 --> 00:44:53,086
Because of him, I found everything
I needed in life…

580
00:44:53,646 --> 00:44:55,566
including a mother's love.

581
00:44:58,366 --> 00:45:01,086
I chose to stay behind to help mother.

582
00:45:01,926 --> 00:45:05,006
While he moved away to Madras
to pursue his higher education.

583
00:45:05,126 --> 00:45:06,246
Hey, Vasanth!

584
00:45:06,366 --> 00:45:08,246
He comes back just once a year.

585
00:45:08,966 --> 00:45:11,726
You visit once a year,
only to leave us again in a few days.

586
00:45:12,046 --> 00:45:14,086
Do you know how much it hurts
to see you leave?

587
00:45:15,006 --> 00:45:16,006
I had to, for studies.

588
00:45:16,366 --> 00:45:18,086
I'm not going anywhere now.

589
00:45:18,326 --> 00:45:20,206
Now that's what I wanted to hear.

590
00:45:20,566 --> 00:45:23,246
Hey, no one should know
what happened in the village.

591
00:45:23,486 --> 00:45:25,006
Especially not aunt.

592
00:45:25,606 --> 00:45:28,126
May the evil eye stay away.
Phew phew.

593
00:45:28,206 --> 00:45:30,686
- How long? Let's go.
- Hey! Hang on a second!

594
00:45:30,686 --> 00:45:31,686
- Come on, Mom.
- Take this.

595
00:45:31,966 --> 00:45:33,566
Everything at the hospital
has been taken care of.

596
00:45:33,646 --> 00:45:35,366
Now you can plan the grand opening.

597
00:45:35,686 --> 00:45:37,806
I have some work at <i>Bharatham Mitta.</i>
Give me the bike keys.

598
00:45:38,326 --> 00:45:39,086
- Here.
- Okay.

599
00:45:39,206 --> 00:45:40,046
- I'll be back.
- Yeah, I'll see you.

600
00:45:40,086 --> 00:45:41,726
Hey, eat something before you leave.

601
00:45:42,126 --> 00:45:43,246
- I'm already full.
- Have it, son.

602
00:45:43,286 --> 00:45:44,926
Uncle is here. Serve him instead.

603
00:45:45,046 --> 00:45:45,886
- Mom.
- Yes.

604
00:45:46,006 --> 00:45:47,206
I sent over
all the required paperwork.

605
00:45:47,806 --> 00:45:49,766
Why did the license take this long?

606
00:45:50,486 --> 00:45:52,406
MLA Raghava Reddy
was demanding a massive cut.

607
00:45:52,686 --> 00:45:54,446
It took some time to convince him
and get the approval.

608
00:45:54,726 --> 00:45:55,766
Why does he want a cut?

609
00:45:56,006 --> 00:45:57,286
The elections are around the corner.

610
00:45:57,566 --> 00:45:59,646
He wants to politicize
your social service.

611
00:45:59,686 --> 00:46:00,886
Why are you sharing all this with him?

612
00:46:01,246 --> 00:46:02,686
Then invite him
as the guest of honor tomorrow.

613
00:46:03,366 --> 00:46:04,366
We'll have him cut the ribbon,

614
00:46:04,686 --> 00:46:06,326
show him proper respect, and send him off.

615
00:46:26,966 --> 00:46:28,006
Uncle Neelakantam,

616
00:46:28,286 --> 00:46:30,286
let women of your household
light the inaugural lamp.

617
00:46:41,366 --> 00:46:43,366
Thank you for gracing us
on such short notice, sir.

618
00:46:45,646 --> 00:46:46,726
Enjoy the feast before you leave.

619
00:46:55,206 --> 00:46:56,486
He humiliated us

620
00:46:56,926 --> 00:46:58,086
because we didn't approve the hospital.

621
00:46:58,646 --> 00:46:59,926
It makes my blood boil

622
00:47:00,206 --> 00:47:01,326
to see you quietly taking all of this.

623
00:47:29,566 --> 00:47:31,406
First, Lenin tore down my banner.

624
00:47:32,206 --> 00:47:34,646
Then Vasanth invites me here
to humiliate me before everyone.

625
00:47:36,006 --> 00:47:36,966
I won't let this go.

626
00:47:38,206 --> 00:47:41,326
Just like him, his father
once stood against the panchayat.

627
00:47:41,686 --> 00:47:42,926
I had him killed in a staged accident.

628
00:47:51,286 --> 00:47:53,006
This time, I won't spare either of them.

629
00:47:56,686 --> 00:47:57,446
Vaidehi.

630
00:48:00,606 --> 00:48:01,686
Don't you understand when I say it once?

631
00:48:01,966 --> 00:48:04,006
If anyone finds you here, you're dead.

632
00:48:04,206 --> 00:48:06,446
- Get out of here.
- Sure, but I'll be back.

633
00:48:07,406 --> 00:48:09,646
- Who was that?
- Just a nobody, Aunt.

634
00:48:09,766 --> 00:48:12,086
He's been ripping off everyone
who visits the shop.

635
00:48:12,366 --> 00:48:14,446
Is Vasanth still at the hospital,
or has he come home?

636
00:48:14,606 --> 00:48:15,566
He's at the temple. Let's go.

637
00:48:20,366 --> 00:48:22,246
Hey, Vasanth. How have you been?

638
00:48:35,486 --> 00:48:38,406
Vasanth, you inaugurated the hospital
with Vaidehi.

639
00:48:38,806 --> 00:48:40,366
Luck will favor you from here on.

640
00:48:47,686 --> 00:48:50,006
Seems like you're looking
for someone special.

641
00:48:50,686 --> 00:48:51,646
He will show up.

642
00:48:58,286 --> 00:48:59,326
Hey, that's mine.

643
00:48:59,686 --> 00:49:01,286
Hey, where is the
Ferris wheel operator?

644
00:49:01,326 --> 00:49:02,726
He ran off, scared of your temper.

645
00:49:02,766 --> 00:49:05,406
Tell him if it stops again,
he won't get a single cent.

646
00:49:05,486 --> 00:49:07,206
That's why I paid him
the full amount up front.

647
00:49:07,286 --> 00:49:09,406
- Why did you pay him upfront, you idiot?
- Hello, sir.

648
00:49:09,726 --> 00:49:10,686
Get down.

649
00:49:11,126 --> 00:49:13,086
I didn’t expect this from you.
Get down.

650
00:49:15,486 --> 00:49:18,086
Take care of the kids. I'll handle her.

651
00:49:18,686 --> 00:49:19,486
Stop it!

652
00:49:20,246 --> 00:49:21,486
- Is it fixed?
- Yes.

653
00:49:25,006 --> 00:49:25,886
What is this?

654
00:49:26,086 --> 00:49:28,726
My father trusted you to protect me,
and you wrote me a love letter?

655
00:49:29,006 --> 00:49:30,046
How dare you?

656
00:49:30,126 --> 00:49:31,966
Today, I'll see your end.

657
00:49:32,366 --> 00:49:33,966
Do you know what would happen
if I showed this to my father?

658
00:49:34,086 --> 00:49:35,366
Alright, We'll do this.

659
00:49:35,926 --> 00:49:37,646
Let's call him. He can read it aloud..

660
00:49:38,326 --> 00:49:39,246
Uncle!

661
00:49:39,886 --> 00:49:42,086
Uncle Neelakantam, come here quickly!

662
00:49:42,326 --> 00:49:43,566
- You need to read a letter.
- Hey.

663
00:49:43,766 --> 00:49:45,006
Why are you shouting?

664
00:49:45,406 --> 00:49:47,726
- What if he actually comes?
- Let him come, Bharathi.

665
00:49:48,006 --> 00:49:48,926
Only then will we know

666
00:49:48,966 --> 00:49:50,806
how an illiterate man wrote a love letter.

667
00:49:51,246 --> 00:49:54,286
What? Don't you know how to write?

668
00:49:54,766 --> 00:49:56,486
I never even learned how to read.

669
00:50:03,366 --> 00:50:05,446
Hey, where are you going?

670
00:50:05,726 --> 00:50:07,086
You were supposed to see my end today.

671
00:50:07,686 --> 00:50:10,366
Fine. If you don't have the guts,
don't read it.

672
00:50:22,366 --> 00:50:23,206
Read.

673
00:50:35,486 --> 00:50:37,286
The moment I saw you,

674
00:50:38,006 --> 00:50:40,686
you looked like a warrior
charging into battle.

675
00:50:47,366 --> 00:50:49,006
Your voice echoed like music
through the crowd.

676
00:50:54,566 --> 00:50:56,966
In your anger, you stood
as a pillar of hope for this village.

677
00:51:05,126 --> 00:51:08,086
You believed in my play,
and challenged me with your words.

678
00:51:09,326 --> 00:51:12,286
You became the sacred vermilion
on my forehead.

679
00:51:19,886 --> 00:51:22,006
It's been 12 days
since the <i>Bharatham Mitta</i> started.

680
00:51:23,006 --> 00:51:25,086
That's 288 hours.

681
00:51:26,046 --> 00:51:28,366
17,280 minutes.

682
00:51:29,486 --> 00:51:32,766
10,36,800 seconds.

683
00:51:34,686 --> 00:51:37,566
Thanks to him, it all flew by in a flash.

684
00:51:39,206 --> 00:51:40,446
If he's with me,

685
00:51:41,446 --> 00:51:44,286
I want to ask him if he can make
this moment last forever.

686
00:51:50,366 --> 00:51:51,246
Tell me.

687
00:51:52,486 --> 00:51:53,326
Will you?

688
00:51:55,726 --> 00:51:56,606
My love!

689
00:52:09,446 --> 00:52:11,606
<i>♪ Hey, did you hear? ♪</i>

690
00:52:11,646 --> 00:52:13,806
<i>♪ Did you hear</i>
<i>What the lovely maiden said? ♪</i>

691
00:52:17,806 --> 00:52:19,966
<i>♪ Hey, are you truly here? ♪</i>

692
00:52:20,006 --> 00:52:22,206
<i>♪ Safe and sound on this earth? ♪</i>

693
00:52:26,206 --> 00:52:29,326
<i>♪ Every path whispers your name ♪</i>

694
00:52:29,446 --> 00:52:32,366
<i>♪ Every heartbeat leaps for you ♪</i>

695
00:52:32,686 --> 00:52:36,046
<i>♪ My heart flutters</i>
<i>And coos like a little dove ♪</i>

696
00:52:36,086 --> 00:52:39,926
<i>♪ What blessing</i>
<i>Brought you into my life? ♪</i>

697
00:52:58,886 --> 00:53:00,926
<i>♪ Hey, did you hear? ♪</i>

698
00:53:00,966 --> 00:53:03,086
<i>♪ Did you hear</i>
<i>What the lovely maiden said? ♪</i>

699
00:53:07,006 --> 00:53:09,206
<i>♪ Hey, are you truly here? ♪</i>

700
00:53:09,246 --> 00:53:11,446
<i>♪ Safe and sound on this earth? ♪</i>

701
00:53:22,606 --> 00:53:24,006
- Sister!
- What is it?

702
00:53:24,086 --> 00:53:25,606
Your prayers have been answered.

703
00:53:25,766 --> 00:53:28,486
Neelakantam agreed to marry
his eldest, Vaidehi, off to Vasanth.

704
00:53:29,006 --> 00:53:32,206
Your prayers have been answered.
Vasanth is marrying into their family.

705
00:53:34,486 --> 00:53:35,326
The day after tomorrow…

706
00:53:35,366 --> 00:53:37,326
On the eighteenth day of <i>Bharatam Mitta</i>.

707
00:53:37,486 --> 00:53:40,126
It's an auspicious day
to exchange the betel leaves.

708
00:53:52,006 --> 00:53:57,966
<i>♪ When you call me My Love</i>
<i>It feels blissful ♪</i>

709
00:53:58,606 --> 00:54:04,566
<i>♪ That sweet, gentle smile of yours</i>
<i>Pulled me into your spell ♪</i>

710
00:54:04,886 --> 00:54:06,366
<i>♪ With a single playful glance ♪</i>

711
00:54:06,366 --> 00:54:11,406
<i>♪ You turned my lonely day</i>
<i>Into a festival for two ♪</i>

712
00:54:11,446 --> 00:54:13,006
<i>♪ If I could only hold your hand ♪</i>

713
00:54:13,006 --> 00:54:17,726
<i>♪ Even a thousand lifetimes</i>
<i>Would never pull us apart ♪</i>

714
00:54:17,886 --> 00:54:21,126
<i>♪ Your love shines like moonlight ♪</i>

715
00:54:21,366 --> 00:54:24,326
<i>♪ Bathing the world in beauty ♪</i>

716
00:54:24,646 --> 00:54:28,006
<i>♪ Let the sky and earth meet each other ♪</i>

717
00:54:28,086 --> 00:54:31,686
<i>♪ If that's what it takes</i>
<i>For you and me to become one ♪</i>

718
00:54:46,286 --> 00:54:48,326
<i>♪ Hey, did you hear? ♪</i>

719
00:54:48,366 --> 00:54:50,366
<i>♪ Did you hear</i>
<i>What the lovely maiden said? ♪</i>

720
00:54:54,366 --> 00:54:56,606
<i>♪ Hey, are you truly here? ♪</i>

721
00:54:56,646 --> 00:54:58,726
<i>♪ Safe and sound on this earth? ♪</i>

722
00:55:10,686 --> 00:55:11,966
Tomorrow is the last day of the fair.

723
00:55:12,326 --> 00:55:13,886
We've looked everywhere for a match.

724
00:55:14,366 --> 00:55:16,366
No drama, no fuss. You're useless.

725
00:55:16,926 --> 00:55:17,806
You brat!

726
00:55:18,766 --> 00:55:21,086
You don't even know
how to pack up a show

727
00:55:21,446 --> 00:55:22,726
and you're calling me useless?

728
00:55:22,926 --> 00:55:25,206
- We still have one day left, right?
- Vaidehi, Vaidehi!

729
00:55:25,286 --> 00:55:26,606
I'll show you what I can do--

730
00:55:26,766 --> 00:55:27,726
- Vaidehi,
- There it is.

731
00:55:27,886 --> 00:55:30,086
- I can't live without you.
- What's with this girl, buddy?

732
00:55:30,326 --> 00:55:32,806
She's getting married tomorrow,
yet she's fooling around with another guy?

733
00:55:33,006 --> 00:55:35,286
Trust me and come with me.

734
00:55:35,926 --> 00:55:37,246
She isn't fooling around.

735
00:55:37,646 --> 00:55:39,486
- She's just settling things with him.
- Seems like it.

736
00:55:40,246 --> 00:55:42,606
- I'll beg at your feet if I have to.
- Hey!

737
00:55:43,766 --> 00:55:44,926
Are you crazy?!

738
00:55:45,086 --> 00:55:46,606
- Why are you falling at my feet?
- Got her now.

739
00:55:46,686 --> 00:55:47,646
- Move!
- Watch me now.

740
00:55:47,806 --> 00:55:49,206
Vaidehi, please wait.

741
00:55:49,286 --> 00:55:51,406
I feel sorry for Nadamuni's family.

742
00:55:52,006 --> 00:55:56,046
The tainted, illegitimate son, Ethirajulu,
keeps lingering around the house.

743
00:55:57,406 --> 00:56:00,366
And now, a tainted bride
is entering their house.

744
00:56:01,126 --> 00:56:02,966
Brother-in-law, brother-in-law.

745
00:56:03,966 --> 00:56:05,326
You know what?

746
00:56:05,486 --> 00:56:06,966
Their family name
should no longer be "Ummadi".

747
00:56:07,046 --> 00:56:08,886
- It should be renamed 'Tainted.'
- Hey!

748
00:56:09,006 --> 00:56:11,726
What are you barking about, you numbskull?

749
00:56:11,966 --> 00:56:12,886
Who are you calling tainted?

750
00:56:13,046 --> 00:56:14,926
- I'll kill you right here!
- Hey, stop!

751
00:56:15,366 --> 00:56:16,366
Let go of him.

752
00:56:18,086 --> 00:56:20,006
He's insulting our family, sister-in-law.

753
00:56:20,086 --> 00:56:21,086
My family!

754
00:56:23,686 --> 00:56:25,326
Because of you,
we have to endure these insults.

755
00:56:29,126 --> 00:56:30,006
Leave.

756
00:56:34,566 --> 00:56:36,646
What are you all staring at? Go.

757
00:56:38,686 --> 00:56:40,046
You started the fire, brother-in-law.

758
00:56:51,486 --> 00:56:53,366
Hey, Dharma Raju Ethirajulu.

759
00:56:54,006 --> 00:56:55,406
I knew you'd be here.

760
00:56:55,446 --> 00:56:56,726
- Let's go home.
- I'm not coming. Go away.

761
00:56:57,566 --> 00:56:58,766
You don't know what happened.

762
00:56:59,246 --> 00:57:02,686
I know, but she's an old woman.
She spoke out of anger.

763
00:57:03,006 --> 00:57:04,406
We only scold the ones we care about.

764
00:57:05,246 --> 00:57:06,006
What?

765
00:57:06,686 --> 00:57:07,646
An old woman?

766
00:57:08,126 --> 00:57:11,046
And she spoke out of anger?

767
00:57:12,446 --> 00:57:15,246
Figures. She was the first one
to welcome you when you arrived.

768
00:57:16,926 --> 00:57:18,366
So you're taking that wench's side.

769
00:57:18,686 --> 00:57:21,046
Hey! Don't disrespect aunt like that.

770
00:57:21,606 --> 00:57:23,046
What are you going to do?

771
00:57:23,686 --> 00:57:24,446
Kill me?

772
00:57:25,206 --> 00:57:26,126
Hack me into pieces?

773
00:57:27,646 --> 00:57:29,366
Here's my head.
Go ahead, and hack me.

774
00:57:29,886 --> 00:57:31,926
- Kill me?
- You lose your mind when you drink.

775
00:57:32,246 --> 00:57:33,686
- Kannaiah, let's go.
- Do it!

776
00:57:34,486 --> 00:57:35,726
Kannaiah, get lost.

777
00:57:36,046 --> 00:57:37,446
You're all the same.

778
00:57:37,886 --> 00:57:38,686
Hey!

779
00:57:39,366 --> 00:57:41,126
My time will come.

780
00:57:42,366 --> 00:57:44,126
Ethirajulu Dharma Raju!

781
00:57:46,886 --> 00:57:47,766
To hell with them.

782
00:57:48,086 --> 00:57:49,366
Ethirajulu here.

783
00:57:49,606 --> 00:57:50,486
Where's my booze?

784
00:58:02,366 --> 00:58:03,686
Damn them all.

785
00:58:24,246 --> 00:58:25,446
Her wedding is in the morning.

786
00:58:26,286 --> 00:58:28,286
Why is she leaving the village?

787
00:58:31,926 --> 00:58:33,006
Vaidehi!

788
00:58:33,686 --> 00:58:34,646
Vaidehi.

789
00:58:35,246 --> 00:58:36,566
Where are you, girl?

790
00:58:37,366 --> 00:58:38,126
Vaidehi.

791
00:58:41,606 --> 00:58:43,046
Father, please forgive me.

792
00:58:45,046 --> 00:58:46,406
I'm in love with someone.

793
00:58:47,886 --> 00:58:50,566
And I can't imagine
living with anyone else.

794
00:58:51,686 --> 00:58:53,686
Our family's honor means
more to you than my love.

795
00:58:55,486 --> 00:58:56,886
So, I'm leaving with him.

796
00:58:58,366 --> 00:59:02,286
I'm sorry for doing this
just before my wedding.

797
00:59:03,966 --> 00:59:05,486
Forgive me, Father.

798
00:59:08,006 --> 00:59:11,406
I never imagined she would do this.

799
00:59:12,646 --> 00:59:14,206
She has tarnished my honor.

800
00:59:14,646 --> 00:59:16,286
Along with yours,
our family's reputation is also ruined.

801
00:59:16,486 --> 00:59:19,366
Hey, what are you saying?
Shut your mouth.

802
00:59:20,606 --> 00:59:23,726
I chose this alliance
to ensure her bright future.

803
00:59:25,046 --> 00:59:27,006
She isn't fortunate enough
to marry into your family.

804
00:59:27,806 --> 00:59:28,926
I suppose we weren't fortunate enough.

805
00:59:29,966 --> 00:59:31,486
Why are you saying that, brother?

806
00:59:32,246 --> 00:59:34,286
Perhaps my son wasn't fortunate enough
to become your son-in-law.

807
00:59:34,766 --> 00:59:35,726
Why not, sister?

808
00:59:36,486 --> 00:59:37,486
There's still a way.

809
00:59:38,206 --> 00:59:40,006
Hey! Get inside right now.

810
00:59:40,126 --> 00:59:42,006
He's not wrong, Jayanthamma.

811
00:59:43,006 --> 00:59:45,366
He expressed what was in my heart.

812
00:59:47,446 --> 00:59:48,366
Vasanth.

813
00:59:54,886 --> 00:59:58,086
Please marry my younger daughter
and spare me this disgrace.

814
00:59:59,006 --> 01:00:00,086
I'll be forever indebted to you.

815
01:00:00,726 --> 01:00:01,646
If I must,

816
01:00:01,926 --> 01:00:03,766
- I'll fall at your feet.
- Stop it, Father-in-law.

817
01:00:05,406 --> 01:00:06,486
What are you doing, Father-in-law?

818
01:00:07,006 --> 01:00:09,686
Even after the engagement,
why are you treating us like strangers?

819
01:00:10,366 --> 01:00:12,086
This is about our shared honor now.

820
01:00:13,046 --> 01:00:14,366
I can understand your situation.

821
01:00:14,726 --> 01:00:16,126
Proceed with the arrangements.

822
01:00:16,606 --> 01:00:18,406
Everything will proceed as planned.
Let's go.

823
01:00:21,486 --> 01:00:22,566
Come on, Aunt.

824
01:00:24,366 --> 01:00:25,406
I'll take my leave.

825
01:00:52,406 --> 01:00:54,486
- Find out who he is.
- Okay, sister.

826
01:00:54,766 --> 01:00:56,046
He's from the neighboring village,
Chandragiri.

827
01:00:56,366 --> 01:00:58,286
Apparently, he's been following her
for a long time.

828
01:00:58,766 --> 01:01:00,246
But our girl wasn't interested, sister.

829
01:01:01,246 --> 01:01:05,246
If she hadn't encouraged him,
would he dare to follow her like this?

830
01:01:06,006 --> 01:01:08,486
A girl should experience love only once..

831
01:01:09,006 --> 01:01:11,406
A second time
opens the door to comparisons.

832
01:01:12,686 --> 01:01:14,126
After the wedding,

833
01:01:14,726 --> 01:01:16,126
what if she feels

834
01:01:17,206 --> 01:01:18,766
his love is deeper than my son's?

835
01:01:22,566 --> 01:01:24,046
My family name is "Ummadi."

836
01:01:25,366 --> 01:01:26,606
I won't accept what's tainted.

837
01:01:27,726 --> 01:01:28,926
I don't understand, sister.

838
01:01:33,366 --> 01:01:35,126
Just as Jayanthi has only one son,

839
01:01:36,206 --> 01:01:38,326
Neelakantam should have
only one son-in-law.

840
01:01:45,006 --> 01:01:46,006
Grab her!

841
01:02:09,006 --> 01:02:11,126
Brother, please let me go.

842
01:02:11,406 --> 01:02:13,646
Who are you people?
Please, don't do this!

843
01:02:21,686 --> 01:02:22,446
Give it to him.

844
01:02:29,646 --> 01:02:33,406
Govind! This letter
must be in Vaidehi's room.

845
01:02:34,366 --> 01:02:38,886
Nobody else must ever find out
what happened here.

846
01:02:57,326 --> 01:02:58,286
Hey, Kannaiah, eat.

847
01:02:59,566 --> 01:03:00,366
Eat it.

848
01:03:00,486 --> 01:03:02,686
Hey! What are you doing here?

849
01:03:03,126 --> 01:03:04,486
What's this about
Bharathi marrying Vasanth?

850
01:03:04,766 --> 01:03:06,286
Hey! Get her out of here.

851
01:03:06,366 --> 01:03:07,726
If anyone shows up, I'll handle them.

852
01:03:07,966 --> 01:03:08,806
Listen to me.

853
01:03:08,926 --> 01:03:11,206
You fool!
That entire family is like that.

854
01:03:11,366 --> 01:03:12,366
Not a single good deed for anyone.

855
01:03:13,286 --> 01:03:14,326
Filthy people!

856
01:03:15,046 --> 01:03:15,886
What?

857
01:03:16,686 --> 01:03:17,686
What are you talking about?

858
01:03:19,006 --> 01:03:20,686
That family gave me a mother.

859
01:03:21,686 --> 01:03:22,726
A friend.

860
01:03:23,486 --> 01:03:26,046
If I asked for Bharathi's hand tonight,
they'd grant me that too.

861
01:03:26,246 --> 01:03:28,046
- Then go ask for it.
- How can I?

862
01:03:28,366 --> 01:03:29,566
How can I possibly ask?

863
01:03:30,726 --> 01:03:32,926
A wedding was called off this morning,
and you want me to stop another one?

864
01:03:34,366 --> 01:03:37,046
If I do that, Vasanth will be the one
hanging his head in shame.

865
01:03:38,766 --> 01:03:41,686
Not everyone gets a chance
to repay a debt.

866
01:03:42,126 --> 01:03:43,006
I did.

867
01:03:44,486 --> 01:03:45,406
I must repay it.

868
01:03:47,006 --> 01:03:48,606
Just think about Bharathi for once.

869
01:03:49,006 --> 01:03:50,566
You wanted to spend
your life with her, didn't you?

870
01:03:50,646 --> 01:03:51,446
I did.

871
01:03:51,926 --> 01:03:53,606
I dreamed of a beautiful future.

872
01:03:55,046 --> 01:03:55,966
Not anymore.

873
01:03:56,886 --> 01:03:57,926
I'll learn to live with it.

874
01:03:58,966 --> 01:03:59,806
Besides,

875
01:04:00,406 --> 01:04:03,326
Since childhood, I've grown used to
losing the people I love.

876
01:04:03,926 --> 01:04:05,446
- Hey, that's not the point.
- Listen to me.

877
01:04:06,206 --> 01:04:07,686
If you get drunk and cause a scene…

878
01:04:09,486 --> 01:04:10,366
I swear on my life.

879
01:04:11,006 --> 01:04:12,006
- I swear.
- Hear me out.

880
01:04:43,246 --> 01:04:45,366
<i>On the final day of the Bharatam Mitta,</i>

881
01:04:45,606 --> 01:04:47,606
<i>we request all visiting devotees.</i>

882
01:04:48,006 --> 01:04:50,806
<i>Those walking on the burning embers,</i>
<i>please refrain from pushing one another.</i>

883
01:04:51,086 --> 01:04:54,486
Offer your prayers peacefully,
and seek Draupadamma's blessings.

884
01:04:55,926 --> 01:04:57,406
Uncle Ethirajulu!

885
01:05:00,126 --> 01:05:01,966
Why is everyone so quiet?

886
01:05:02,006 --> 01:05:03,206
Do something, Uncle.

887
01:05:05,606 --> 01:05:08,206
Listen, cut the power
the moment he’s about to tie the knot.

888
01:05:10,606 --> 01:05:12,486
The moment the lights go out,
bring Bharathi to the vehicle.

889
01:05:15,206 --> 01:05:16,046
Hey, Dwaraka.

890
01:05:16,566 --> 01:05:18,046
- Have the car ready.
- Understood.

891
01:05:20,126 --> 01:05:22,446
You, stay right by Bharathi’s side.

892
01:05:24,046 --> 01:05:27,086
Let's see how this wedding happens. Go!

893
01:05:28,126 --> 01:05:30,766
Hurry up, and be there on time.

894
01:05:31,086 --> 01:05:32,726
Get up! Hurry!

895
01:05:42,286 --> 01:05:43,046
Hey, stop!

896
01:05:43,286 --> 01:05:46,646
Who are you to just walk straight in?
Get back. Get back! Now!

897
01:05:46,726 --> 01:05:48,366
Blocking the groom's way, idiots!

898
01:06:02,206 --> 01:06:04,886
Hey, Balaji, Balaji.
Come here.

899
01:06:06,206 --> 01:06:07,366
Where are you going?

900
01:06:07,686 --> 01:06:09,206
Where is Lenin?

901
01:06:09,326 --> 01:06:10,686
- I haven't seen him all day.
- Actually, Lenin--

902
01:06:10,726 --> 01:06:12,006
- Hey!
- What happened?

903
01:06:12,046 --> 01:06:13,086
Dude, where's Lenin?

904
01:06:14,406 --> 01:06:16,486
- He went to town for urgent work.
- He went to town.

905
01:06:16,606 --> 01:06:18,286
- He'll be back in ten minutes. Let's go.
- I see.

906
01:06:18,366 --> 01:06:21,446
Guys, it's my wedding today.
Stay right by my side.

907
01:06:31,646 --> 01:06:32,806
Hey, go and see.

908
01:07:17,646 --> 01:07:18,886
The auspicious time is running out.

909
01:07:18,926 --> 01:07:20,446
- Tie the knot.
- Just ten more minutes, Priest.

910
01:07:20,566 --> 01:07:22,366
Lenin is on his way.
I'll tie it once he's here.

911
01:07:22,366 --> 01:07:24,446
- Time is running out. Just tie the knot.
- But Mom--

912
01:07:24,566 --> 01:07:26,366
- Do it.
- I don't like you, Vasanth.

913
01:07:32,246 --> 01:07:33,686
I don't want this marriage, Vasanth.

914
01:07:44,966 --> 01:07:46,326
And you're telling me this now?

915
01:07:46,766 --> 01:07:48,006
When else should I have said it, Dad?

916
01:07:50,406 --> 01:07:53,006
You asked everyone if they
wanted to marry your daughter.

917
01:07:54,366 --> 01:07:55,366
Did you ever bother to ask me?

918
01:07:56,726 --> 01:07:59,326
When your daughter went missing,
you should have looked for her, Dad.

919
01:08:00,366 --> 01:08:01,806
Not the lost honor.

920
01:08:03,486 --> 01:08:05,566
Since childhood, you've told me
to live life on my terms.

921
01:08:06,886 --> 01:08:08,686
But today, you didn't even bother
to ask what I wanted.

922
01:08:09,766 --> 01:08:10,686
Why, Dad?

923
01:08:13,246 --> 01:08:14,246
And you, Mom.

924
01:08:14,966 --> 01:08:17,206
You asked me if I liked this saree
or that jewelry.

925
01:08:18,086 --> 01:08:20,246
But did you even bother
to ask if I liked the groom?

926
01:08:24,526 --> 01:08:26,566
I didn't expect
anything better from them, Vasanth.

927
01:08:27,806 --> 01:08:31,246
Because I never thought
highly of them anyway.

928
01:08:33,086 --> 01:08:34,646
But I expected it from you.

929
01:08:35,526 --> 01:08:37,646
I thought you'd
at least ask if I liked you.

930
01:08:38,406 --> 01:08:40,686
I thought you'd question them
when they replaced the bride.

931
01:08:41,566 --> 01:08:42,446
But you didn't.

932
01:08:43,046 --> 01:08:46,006
Am I a doll in a shop, Vasanth?
To be replaced if one doesn't work out?

933
01:08:48,646 --> 01:08:49,606
I'm a woman.

934
01:08:51,646 --> 01:08:52,606
You should ask.

935
01:08:55,766 --> 01:08:58,486
At least before tying the knot,
you should ask her consent.

936
01:09:03,246 --> 01:09:05,126
On one hand, I'm terrified
about my sister's whereabouts.

937
01:09:05,966 --> 01:09:08,286
On the other hand,
a marriage I never agreed to.

938
01:09:08,726 --> 01:09:10,646
I was torn between the two, Vasanth.

939
01:09:12,366 --> 01:09:14,806
The past 24 hours have been a living hell.

940
01:09:16,006 --> 01:09:18,726
That's why I had no choice
but to speak up in front of everyone.

941
01:09:19,006 --> 01:09:22,086
Alright, let's assume no one asked you.

942
01:09:22,566 --> 01:09:26,526
What reason could you possibly have
to reject Vasanth, such a gem of a guy?

943
01:09:26,646 --> 01:09:29,366
Unless… You're in love with someone else.

944
01:09:32,286 --> 01:09:34,806
For the first time,
you actually sound like a gentleman.

945
01:09:36,246 --> 01:09:37,046
Yes.

946
01:09:38,726 --> 01:09:40,046
I am in love with Lenin.

947
01:09:50,246 --> 01:09:51,926
My heart beats for him, Vasanth.

948
01:09:54,686 --> 01:09:55,886
If you still don't care…

949
01:09:57,006 --> 01:09:59,446
And want to tie the knot regardless,
it's your choice.

950
01:10:04,206 --> 01:10:05,246
Tie it right now.

951
01:10:05,366 --> 01:10:06,726
You've humiliated me in public.

952
01:10:06,806 --> 01:10:07,966
- You!
- Uncle.

953
01:10:09,446 --> 01:10:11,206
We've made enough mistakes already, Uncle.

954
01:10:12,566 --> 01:10:13,886
Do you want to hit her
and make another mistake?

955
01:10:18,966 --> 01:10:22,606
Sitting here without ever asking
for her consent…

956
01:10:24,646 --> 01:10:26,246
I loathe myself.

957
01:10:33,126 --> 01:10:34,086
Forgive me, Bharathi.

958
01:10:36,966 --> 01:10:38,206
I declare this in front of everyone.

959
01:10:39,246 --> 01:10:40,366
Even if I have to go against everyone,

960
01:10:41,446 --> 01:10:42,606
I will ensure you two get married.

961
01:10:45,286 --> 01:10:46,286
You have my word.

962
01:10:48,286 --> 01:10:49,246
Come!

963
01:11:21,686 --> 01:11:22,766
Why the hell are you up on this hill

964
01:11:22,886 --> 01:11:24,206
when you're supposed
to be marrying Bharathi?

965
01:11:24,926 --> 01:11:25,886
She told me.

966
01:11:29,046 --> 01:11:30,046
But you didn't.

967
01:11:33,286 --> 01:11:36,406
A bride is supposed to
bow her head at the wedding.

968
01:11:36,966 --> 01:11:38,686
But because of you two,
I've hung my head in shame.

969
01:11:39,806 --> 01:11:41,006
You made me feel like an outsider.

970
01:11:41,726 --> 01:11:42,806
Forgive me, man.

971
01:11:43,086 --> 01:11:44,326
Oh no, why?

972
01:11:44,766 --> 01:11:48,286
Because you want to make noble sacrifices
and portray me as the villain?

973
01:11:51,086 --> 01:11:54,006
Honestly, for dragging this matter
this far,

974
01:11:54,366 --> 01:11:55,646
I can't forgive either of you.

975
01:11:58,686 --> 01:12:02,286
But if I'm going to let it go
just because we're friends…

976
01:12:05,086 --> 01:12:06,126
You must make me…

977
01:12:08,486 --> 01:12:09,566
Hold my head high.

978
01:12:17,246 --> 01:12:18,006
Go on.

979
01:12:18,686 --> 01:12:19,486
Go tie the knot.

980
01:12:22,046 --> 01:12:25,006
<i>Bharatham Mitta</i> in the distance
will bear witness to this wedding.

981
01:12:25,726 --> 01:12:27,366
I'm with you. Go, man.

982
01:12:38,686 --> 01:12:39,646
Go on.

983
01:13:07,366 --> 01:13:08,206
My love.

984
01:14:57,566 --> 01:14:58,446
Lenin!

985
01:14:59,006 --> 01:15:01,006
Bharathi, go with Vasanth.

986
01:15:01,446 --> 01:15:02,566
I'll be right back!

987
01:15:02,886 --> 01:15:03,726
Lenin.

988
01:16:32,366 --> 01:16:34,686
Who sent you?

989
01:17:03,686 --> 01:17:05,686
Who would send
thugs to kill Vasanth, brother?

990
01:17:07,006 --> 01:17:07,966
MLA?

991
01:17:10,966 --> 01:17:11,926
Damodaram?

992
01:17:16,446 --> 01:17:17,606
Could it be Tulasi from Kothacheruvu?

993
01:17:20,686 --> 01:17:21,446
Brother?

994
01:17:22,326 --> 01:17:23,086
Brother?

995
01:17:25,486 --> 01:17:26,486
Yes, Venkata Swamy.

996
01:17:26,686 --> 01:17:29,366
Sir, just as you instructed, we've checked
on all the suspects in Lenin's case.

997
01:17:29,606 --> 01:17:30,566
None of them is around.

998
01:17:30,646 --> 01:17:31,686
We were told they had left.

999
01:17:32,006 --> 01:17:33,926
Where did everyone disappear to
all of a sudden?

1000
01:17:50,366 --> 01:17:53,646
Who else would send thugs
to kill Vasanth, brother?

1001
01:17:54,206 --> 01:17:56,686
Before I reveal who,
let me share a brief story.

1002
01:17:58,446 --> 01:18:00,206
Once upon a time,
in the Seshachalam Forest…

1003
01:18:01,286 --> 01:18:03,006
A leopard lived there.

1004
01:18:03,886 --> 01:18:06,646
A few years ago, it was injured
and retreated into a cave.

1005
01:18:07,206 --> 01:18:08,766
It finally stepped out today.

1006
01:18:09,006 --> 01:18:11,246
On one hand, it has an unhealing wound

1007
01:18:12,366 --> 01:18:14,726
and on the other, an insatiable hunger.

1008
01:18:16,046 --> 01:18:17,886
Do you know how hungry it was?

1009
01:18:19,886 --> 01:18:23,206
It wanted to devour every single animal
in the forest at once.

1010
01:18:25,606 --> 01:18:26,566
That's why…

1011
01:18:27,406 --> 01:18:29,806
the moment it stepped out,
the leopard thought it through.

1012
01:18:31,406 --> 01:18:33,206
It meticulously planned a trap

1013
01:18:33,886 --> 01:18:36,766
and lured all the animals to one spot.

1014
01:18:40,286 --> 01:18:41,366
How pitiful.

1015
01:18:42,726 --> 01:18:45,566
Those animals actually thought
they could hunt the leopard.

1016
01:18:45,806 --> 01:18:47,806
But what they don't realize…

1017
01:18:49,566 --> 01:18:51,326
is that what stands before them
isn't a leopard.

1018
01:18:53,686 --> 01:18:54,686
It's Lenin!

1019
01:19:10,806 --> 01:19:11,766
By the way…

1020
01:19:13,646 --> 01:19:16,286
You asked who sent the goons
to kill Vasanth, didn't you?

1021
01:19:16,366 --> 01:19:17,366
Yes, bro.

1022
01:19:17,686 --> 01:19:19,486
I brought him along with me.

1023
01:19:22,486 --> 01:19:24,086
Didn't anyone notice?

1024
01:19:36,686 --> 01:19:37,686
Who is that?

1025
01:20:07,686 --> 01:20:09,686
The Final Chapter of Kurukshetra.

1026
01:20:13,286 --> 01:20:14,366
The grand revelation.

1027
01:20:19,446 --> 01:20:22,646
Do you know what Lord Krishna
told Arjuna in Kurukshetra?

1028
01:20:24,246 --> 01:20:26,606
Even a war should be fought calmly.

1029
01:20:28,486 --> 01:20:29,326
What?

1030
01:20:30,286 --> 01:20:31,806
Should we do the same?

1031
01:20:35,046 --> 01:20:37,326
Do you know the meaning behind
the cosmic form Lenin drew?

1032
01:20:39,006 --> 01:20:42,166
When Arjuna hesitated to kill his own kin
on the battlefield of Kurukshetra,

1033
01:20:43,006 --> 01:20:44,766
Lord Krishna told him something crucial.

1034
01:20:45,246 --> 01:20:46,006
"This is war."

1035
01:20:46,966 --> 01:20:48,206
"Do your duty."

1036
01:20:49,646 --> 01:20:50,966
If my guess is right…

1037
01:20:51,646 --> 01:20:53,766
he has brought everyone to one place.

1038
01:21:01,086 --> 01:21:02,966
If killing them is his duty,

1039
01:21:04,846 --> 01:21:06,046
then stopping him is ours.

1040
01:21:19,246 --> 01:21:20,286
- Delhi.
- Brother.

1041
01:21:20,886 --> 01:21:22,166
That's one severed head.

1042
01:21:25,206 --> 01:21:26,766
Count how many more are left.

1043
01:21:31,046 --> 01:21:33,366
Including the severed head,
there are 99 men, brother.

1044
01:21:48,486 --> 01:21:51,646
Sir, it's been three days
since <i>Bharatham Mitta</i> concluded.

1045
01:21:52,166 --> 01:21:54,006
Why are there smokes in the pyre pit?

1046
01:21:54,646 --> 01:21:57,006
Last time, <i>Pushpa Yagam</i>
was already taking place.

1047
01:21:57,606 --> 01:22:00,286
I don't get it too.
Let's wait for a couple of days.

1048
01:22:06,006 --> 01:22:08,886
Let's see
how this wedding takes place.

1049
01:22:08,926 --> 01:22:09,726
Go.

1050
01:22:10,046 --> 01:22:12,206
The power will go out right when Vasanth
is about to tie the knot.

1051
01:22:13,286 --> 01:22:14,926
And before the lights come back on,
he must die.

1052
01:22:15,166 --> 01:22:16,006
Wait!

1053
01:22:16,606 --> 01:22:19,566
Who do you think you are,
barging straight inside? Go back.

1054
01:22:19,726 --> 01:22:20,646
Go back.

1055
01:22:24,686 --> 01:22:27,926
Brother-in-law. Why is Ethirajulu
going into this lodge?

1056
01:22:30,886 --> 01:22:33,166
He's a lonely man, after all.
Maybe he's looking for some company.

1057
01:22:34,046 --> 01:22:35,766
Should we go in as well?

1058
01:22:36,166 --> 01:22:39,006
Ugh! I haven't stooped so low
as to watch him in his naked glory.

1059
01:22:39,166 --> 01:22:41,326
- Let's just take a quick look.
- Go and get the groceries for your sister.

1060
01:22:41,366 --> 01:22:42,246
- I am leaving brother-in-law.
- Go.

1061
01:22:56,966 --> 01:22:58,366
- Who's there?
- It's me.

1062
01:23:06,206 --> 01:23:08,206
Take all the money and get out.

1063
01:23:08,686 --> 01:23:11,486
We don't accept payment
until the job is done.

1064
01:23:12,286 --> 01:23:14,326
Hey, what's this?

1065
01:23:15,726 --> 01:23:17,246
You only lost a hand this time.

1066
01:23:18,406 --> 01:23:19,926
If you want to stay alive, leave.

1067
01:23:21,606 --> 01:23:23,046
Lenin has started hunting.

1068
01:23:24,006 --> 01:23:25,406
If he finds out you are involved…

1069
01:23:26,366 --> 01:23:29,206
your head will roll, you numbskull!

1070
01:23:34,086 --> 01:23:37,566
If he reached you,
it means he has found me.

1071
01:23:38,886 --> 01:23:40,486
I will call you when the time comes.

1072
01:23:41,406 --> 01:23:42,286
Go now.

1073
01:23:53,526 --> 01:23:54,566
Hey!

1074
01:23:54,966 --> 01:23:58,206
Why are you looking
at me like that, Kannaiah?

1075
01:23:58,406 --> 01:23:59,526
I did nothing wrong.

1076
01:24:00,926 --> 01:24:04,526
On her deathbed, my mother told me
to live a righteous life.

1077
01:24:06,006 --> 01:24:08,006
To live like Dharma Raju.

1078
01:24:09,326 --> 01:24:11,966
Since that day,
I've walked the path of righteousness.

1079
01:24:13,166 --> 01:24:15,246
But no matter how righteous I was…

1080
01:24:15,846 --> 01:24:19,526
every wagging tongue in this village says
there is no honor in my birth.

1081
01:24:19,646 --> 01:24:23,886
Ethirajulu, his father's illegitimate son
keeps loitering around.

1082
01:24:23,966 --> 01:24:25,966
They call me a mistress's son.

1083
01:24:26,526 --> 01:24:27,286
Hey,

1084
01:24:27,966 --> 01:24:31,606
Kannaiah, I didn't even marry anyone
because of those insults.

1085
01:24:33,286 --> 01:24:35,846
Oh, let them talk, Kannaiah.

1086
01:24:36,046 --> 01:24:37,566
People will spew
whatever nonsense they want.

1087
01:24:41,086 --> 01:24:41,966
But, Kannaiah…

1088
01:24:42,846 --> 01:24:44,646
if we want to shut
all those wagging tongues,

1089
01:24:45,246 --> 01:24:46,846
I need to become Dharma Raju!

1090
01:24:58,686 --> 01:25:01,326
When I walk down the street
with that title…

1091
01:25:03,646 --> 01:25:05,286
Everyone who mocked me,

1092
01:25:07,326 --> 01:25:08,886
especially my sister-in-law.

1093
01:25:09,726 --> 01:25:12,006
will greet me with folded hands.

1094
01:25:15,206 --> 01:25:17,166
As long as my sister-in-law
and her family are around,

1095
01:25:17,886 --> 01:25:19,486
I can never become Dharma Raju!

1096
01:25:23,486 --> 01:25:26,486
When all the roads
in my life were closed,

1097
01:25:27,246 --> 01:25:28,886
a new path finally opened before me.

1098
01:25:56,886 --> 01:25:59,766
Except for the two of us,
no one else must ever know about this.

1099
01:25:59,926 --> 01:26:00,726
Okay, sister.

1100
01:26:04,686 --> 01:26:07,166
If I expose that my sister-in-law
is the one who had Vaidehi killed,

1101
01:26:08,206 --> 01:26:09,286
she will be finished.

1102
01:26:09,646 --> 01:26:11,646
The only one left
in the family is Vasanth.

1103
01:26:12,286 --> 01:26:15,486
Even though I've looked up to him
as an uncle since I was little,

1104
01:26:16,246 --> 01:26:17,926
he was swayed by his mother's manipulation

1105
01:26:18,366 --> 01:26:20,526
and always sidelined me.

1106
01:26:20,886 --> 01:26:22,526
And then, the moment he arrived,

1107
01:26:22,726 --> 01:26:23,686
He invited the MLA

1108
01:26:23,726 --> 01:26:25,646
for the hospital inauguration
and picked a fight with him.

1109
01:26:26,086 --> 01:26:28,206
Everyone's eyes were locked on Vasanth.

1110
01:26:28,966 --> 01:26:30,526
Taking advantage of that,

1111
01:26:30,846 --> 01:26:34,166
I planned to kill him
and pin the blame on them, Kannaiah.

1112
01:26:35,286 --> 01:26:37,406
But I missed him by a whisker.

1113
01:26:43,846 --> 01:26:45,886
I give you my word today, Kannaiah.

1114
01:26:47,086 --> 01:26:49,606
Whatever it takes,
I will become Dharma Raju.

1115
01:26:51,166 --> 01:26:52,766
Even if I have to stray
from the righteous path,

1116
01:26:52,846 --> 01:26:54,486
I will claim that title.

1117
01:27:25,886 --> 01:27:26,646
Where were you?

1118
01:27:26,726 --> 01:27:28,886
To find out who sent thugs after you.

1119
01:27:29,486 --> 01:27:31,246
Raghava Reddy hasn't returned
from Hyderabad yet.

1120
01:27:31,366 --> 01:27:32,966
Do you even realize what you are doing?

1121
01:27:34,926 --> 01:27:36,406
Without a second thought…

1122
01:27:36,766 --> 01:27:37,686
Bharathi left everything for you.

1123
01:27:38,886 --> 01:27:40,166
Have you given her feelings
any thought at all?

1124
01:27:42,046 --> 01:27:43,086
- It's not that--
- Hey.

1125
01:27:44,166 --> 01:27:46,166
When that day comes,
no one gets spared. Got it?

1126
01:27:50,886 --> 01:27:53,406
I gave Bharathi my word
that I'd get her married to you.

1127
01:27:54,326 --> 01:27:55,286
Go take care of that first.

1128
01:27:59,046 --> 01:27:59,926
Hey.

1129
01:28:00,326 --> 01:28:01,326
Above everything else…

1130
01:28:02,006 --> 01:28:03,206
your happiness
is what matters most to me.

1131
01:28:28,286 --> 01:28:30,966
Uncle, for someone
who left everything behind…

1132
01:28:31,526 --> 01:28:32,486
this village became my whole world.

1133
01:28:33,526 --> 01:28:35,166
Ever since, <i>Bharatham Mitta</i>
has been my home.

1134
01:28:35,366 --> 01:28:36,286
And you became my family.

1135
01:28:36,646 --> 01:28:38,886
If even a single person among you
disapproves of my wedding…

1136
01:28:39,566 --> 01:28:40,366
I won't go through with it.

1137
01:28:41,086 --> 01:28:43,606
I saw how sad you were
when Vaidehi ran away.

1138
01:28:44,846 --> 01:28:46,926
But I should never be the reason for that.

1139
01:28:48,646 --> 01:28:50,686
Today, Bharathi walked away
from everything for me.

1140
01:28:51,646 --> 01:28:53,726
But I am equally ready
to walk away from her.

1141
01:28:55,406 --> 01:28:57,086
But before I go,
let me say one last thing.

1142
01:28:58,846 --> 01:29:00,646
Whenever trouble strikes
the neighboring villages,

1143
01:29:00,646 --> 01:29:01,646
you always lend them a hand.

1144
01:29:02,166 --> 01:29:04,966
That hand of yours has never cared
about race, caste, or creed.

1145
01:29:08,366 --> 01:29:10,366
I ask you this
while holding that very hand.

1146
01:29:11,566 --> 01:29:12,726
Will you give me
your daughter's hand

1147
01:29:13,086 --> 01:29:14,646
and bless us with a future, Uncle?

1148
01:29:18,246 --> 01:29:19,766
I'll cherish her for a lifetime.

1149
01:29:45,246 --> 01:29:48,726
♪ Adorned with the sacred bindi
Holding the wooden pestles ♪

1150
01:29:52,246 --> 01:29:55,766
♪ To pound the vibrant yellow turmeric,
The entire village has joyously arrived! ♪

1151
01:29:55,886 --> 01:29:58,966
♪ The wedding preparations
Have finally begun ♪

1152
01:29:59,166 --> 01:30:02,526
♪ The sacred wedding pillar
Has been firmly planted in the earth ♪

1153
01:30:02,646 --> 01:30:06,006
♪ Praying for this grand ceremony
To pass flawlessly ♪

1154
01:30:06,166 --> 01:30:09,486
♪ We bow to the three-crore deities ♪

1155
01:30:09,646 --> 01:30:12,966
♪ Victory and auspiciousness
Eternal joy and blessings! ♪

1156
01:30:13,046 --> 01:30:16,486
♪ Victory and auspiciousness
Eternal joy and blessings! ♪

1157
01:30:23,526 --> 01:30:26,606
♪ Look at this handsome groom, oh my! ♪

1158
01:30:26,926 --> 01:30:29,966
♪ He is hard to find, oh yes! ♪

1159
01:30:30,406 --> 01:30:33,646
♪ He is a man whose word never wavers ♪

1160
01:30:33,886 --> 01:30:36,766
♪ Born of fierce and noble blood ♪

1161
01:30:36,846 --> 01:30:40,406
♪ This bride is the very moon on earth ♪

1162
01:30:40,886 --> 01:30:43,686
♪ She is the divine abode of all virtues ♪

1163
01:30:43,726 --> 01:30:47,846
♪ May this beautiful couple
Flourish for eternity! ♪

1164
01:30:47,886 --> 01:30:50,766
♪ For the long-lived
And blessed Alamelu Mangamma ♪

1165
01:30:51,286 --> 01:30:54,366
♪ And the ever-smiling Lord Seenayya ♪

1166
01:30:54,726 --> 01:30:57,966
♪ This beautiful wedding
Unfolding before us ♪

1167
01:30:58,246 --> 01:31:01,646
♪ Is a magnificent celebration
For the entire world! ♪

1168
01:31:01,726 --> 01:31:04,886
♪ Oh! The grand wedding of Seenayya ♪

1169
01:31:05,246 --> 01:31:08,966
♪ The glorious celebration
Of Alamelu Mangamma! ♪

1170
01:31:16,046 --> 01:31:18,046
♪ I swear upon the leaves
Of the wedding canopy ♪

1171
01:31:18,086 --> 01:31:20,206
♪ I swear upon
These sacred wedding seats ♪

1172
01:31:20,526 --> 01:31:22,326
♪ I swear upon
The five sacred elements of nature! ♪

1173
01:31:22,486 --> 01:31:25,526
♪ Oh Chittedu Kondalu
Beat the traditional drums loud ♪

1174
01:31:25,966 --> 01:31:29,326
♪ Oh Janaki Bai, step forward
And hold the bride's long braid ♪

1175
01:31:29,766 --> 01:31:34,046
♪ O Lord of gentle smiles
Tie the sacred thread of marriage! ♪

1176
01:31:34,326 --> 01:31:36,966
♪ Around the neck of this sweet girl ♪

1177
01:31:37,006 --> 01:31:39,486
♪ Leave a sweet, lingering tickle! ♪

1178
01:31:46,766 --> 01:31:50,246
♪ I swear and declare over and again ♪

1179
01:31:50,286 --> 01:31:53,646
♪ I was born on this earth
Solely to be your partner ♪

1180
01:31:53,646 --> 01:31:57,366
♪ I will be the soothing moonlight
On your path ♪

1181
01:31:57,406 --> 01:32:00,086
♪ I will walk with you
Until the end of time ♪

1182
01:32:00,206 --> 01:32:03,926
♪ Like the black beads
On the sacred thread of my queen ♪

1183
01:32:04,206 --> 01:32:07,326
♪ I will be the companion of your soul
For every single breath ♪

1184
01:32:07,646 --> 01:32:10,886
♪ For the delicate flower who trusted me ♪

1185
01:32:11,086 --> 01:32:14,486
♪ I will gift her the entire heavens ♪

1186
01:32:14,606 --> 01:32:18,046
♪ As your loving wife
As your devoted homemaker ♪

1187
01:32:18,086 --> 01:32:21,606
♪ I will never let go of your hand
Through all our lifetimes! ♪

1188
01:32:35,406 --> 01:32:38,526
♪ Oh! The grand wedding of Seenayya ♪

1189
01:32:39,006 --> 01:32:41,966
♪ The glorious celebration
Of Alamelu Mangamma! ♪

1190
01:33:02,006 --> 01:33:02,846
Goddess Mother,

1191
01:33:03,646 --> 01:33:05,766
the sacred pyre must cool down
for the ritual to begin.

1192
01:33:06,966 --> 01:33:08,726
Perhaps the roots
deep underground caught fire,

1193
01:33:09,286 --> 01:33:11,406
because it is still
smoldering from within.

1194
01:33:12,246 --> 01:33:13,686
Dousing it bodes ill for the village.

1195
01:33:20,646 --> 01:33:22,406
Protect us from all harm, Goddess Mother.

1196
01:33:39,206 --> 01:33:40,166
Ethirajulu.

1197
01:33:41,006 --> 01:33:43,286
You know why we called here?

1198
01:33:48,166 --> 01:33:49,526
You only lost a hand this time.

1199
01:33:49,606 --> 01:33:51,006
If you want to stay alive, leave.

1200
01:33:56,606 --> 01:33:58,046
We don't care
about your personal grudge.

1201
01:33:59,366 --> 01:34:01,206
But to kill Vasanth,

1202
01:34:01,886 --> 01:34:03,566
you have our full backing.

1203
01:34:05,846 --> 01:34:06,846
Why are you silent?

1204
01:34:07,486 --> 01:34:08,966
We won't lay a finger on Lenin.

1205
01:34:11,686 --> 01:34:12,726
You couldn't, even if you tried.

1206
01:34:19,486 --> 01:34:20,566
Tell me, what do you want me to do?

1207
01:34:23,966 --> 01:34:24,766
Hey.

1208
01:34:29,526 --> 01:34:30,846
Get him a job inside the hospital.

1209
01:34:32,606 --> 01:34:34,006
We need to pick an auspicious time

1210
01:34:34,846 --> 01:34:35,966
to hunt down Vasanth.

1211
01:34:40,926 --> 01:34:42,566
If you don't cut back on sweets now,

1212
01:34:43,206 --> 01:34:44,406
diabetes will kill you.

1213
01:34:44,566 --> 01:34:45,566
Consider this my final warning.

1214
01:34:50,406 --> 01:34:51,646
Who is the new kid?

1215
01:34:54,246 --> 01:34:56,366
Him? He joined recently.

1216
01:34:56,726 --> 01:34:57,726
Alright, you get some rest now.

1217
01:34:57,846 --> 01:34:58,886
Okay. Be careful.

1218
01:34:59,566 --> 01:35:01,526
Hey, we have to tend to uncle every day.

1219
01:35:01,686 --> 01:35:03,246
Make sure to keep reminding me.

1220
01:35:06,366 --> 01:35:08,006
Around 8:00 pm every night,

1221
01:35:08,366 --> 01:35:11,006
he visits the field to give
his uncle an injection, brother.

1222
01:35:22,566 --> 01:35:24,526
He told us to meet him here,
but why hasn't he arrived yet?

1223
01:35:24,766 --> 01:35:27,486
He went to the station
to inquire about Vaidehi, Uncle.

1224
01:35:30,046 --> 01:35:30,926
Bharathi.

1225
01:35:32,326 --> 01:35:33,246
He's here.

1226
01:35:35,686 --> 01:35:36,726
Did you find out anything?

1227
01:35:37,486 --> 01:35:39,566
What I always say.
They're actively looking.

1228
01:35:39,766 --> 01:35:41,166
I told a lot of other people too.

1229
01:35:41,246 --> 01:35:42,006
Hey!

1230
01:35:42,926 --> 01:35:44,886
I asked my acquaintances
in Madras to look for her.

1231
01:35:45,166 --> 01:35:45,966
Are they actively looking?

1232
01:35:46,206 --> 01:35:47,686
Everyone is strictly on the case.

1233
01:35:48,526 --> 01:35:50,286
The truth will surface very soon.

1234
01:35:56,926 --> 01:35:58,766
My love, please don't worry.

1235
01:35:59,286 --> 01:36:01,846
No matter where Vaidehi is,
it's my responsibility to bring her back.

1236
01:36:03,286 --> 01:36:04,046
Okay.

1237
01:36:06,646 --> 01:36:07,406
My love.

1238
01:36:08,646 --> 01:36:09,406
My love.

1239
01:36:10,286 --> 01:36:10,926
What happened?

1240
01:36:18,006 --> 01:36:19,526
Hey, Lenin, you son of a gun!

1241
01:36:21,006 --> 01:36:23,086
Hey! Junior Lenin is coming!

1242
01:36:31,646 --> 01:36:34,206
This is the happiest
moment of our lives, Vasanth.

1243
01:36:35,406 --> 01:36:38,326
- Thank you so much.
- Don't bow to me like I'm a saint.

1244
01:36:38,646 --> 01:36:40,646
- I have to tell Mom the good news.
- Doctor!

1245
01:36:41,006 --> 01:36:42,286
- Doctor!
- Vasanth, son!

1246
01:36:43,646 --> 01:36:44,766
Bring her in!

1247
01:36:45,006 --> 01:36:46,686
- What's wrong?
- Bharathi!

1248
01:36:46,846 --> 01:36:49,286
- I brought her a perfect match…
- What happened?

1249
01:36:49,286 --> 01:36:51,686
- but she says she loves some stranger.
- Hurry, take her inside!

1250
01:36:52,286 --> 01:36:56,046
- Because I said no, she took farm poison!
- Hurry. Don't panic.

1251
01:36:56,206 --> 01:36:59,286
- Oh no! Oh dear!
- She will be fine. Don't worry.

1252
01:37:11,526 --> 01:37:12,286
Vasanth?

1253
01:37:13,526 --> 01:37:15,966
You brought her just in time.
She is out of danger.

1254
01:37:16,646 --> 01:37:19,326
She needs twenty-four hours of rest.
Don't disturb her. Okay?

1255
01:37:19,406 --> 01:37:20,606
You can see her once she wakes up.

1256
01:37:20,646 --> 01:37:21,646
You're unbelievable, Uncle!

1257
01:37:21,686 --> 01:37:24,526
Have you lost your mind, Uncle?
How can you even think like this?

1258
01:37:25,286 --> 01:37:26,686
Honor can be won back,

1259
01:37:27,206 --> 01:37:28,286
but a lost child can never return.

1260
01:37:28,646 --> 01:37:29,686
- Think about it once, Uncle.
- Uncle, please.

1261
01:37:29,846 --> 01:37:31,646
Bharathi! Bharathi! Let's go.
Hey, come on! Let's go!

1262
01:37:32,206 --> 01:37:33,566
I'm leaving, Uncle.
Hey…

1263
01:37:34,246 --> 01:37:36,286
Let's stop by the farm on the way
and give Uncle his insulin.

1264
01:37:36,526 --> 01:37:37,486
- Hmm?
- Okay.

1265
01:38:11,486 --> 01:38:14,606
Brother! Along with that Vasanth
Lenin and Bharathi are also coming.

1266
01:38:15,366 --> 01:38:16,766
We got all those fools!

1267
01:38:17,166 --> 01:38:17,966
Hey!

1268
01:38:18,686 --> 01:38:21,206
What do you mean
Lenin and Bharathi are coming?

1269
01:38:22,926 --> 01:38:24,366
I swear, each
and every one of you!

1270
01:38:24,406 --> 01:38:25,566
If anyone lays a finger on them,

1271
01:38:25,886 --> 01:38:27,326
- Damn you, Raghava Reddy!
- Hey!

1272
01:38:27,366 --> 01:38:29,046
- I will rip your throat out!
- Hey.

1273
01:38:29,166 --> 01:38:30,726
- What can you even do?
- Hey, pull him away.

1274
01:38:30,846 --> 01:38:32,246
- Take him away!
- Let me go, you numbskulls!

1275
01:38:32,486 --> 01:38:33,286
Let me go!

1276
01:38:33,646 --> 01:38:34,486
Let me go!

1277
01:38:34,686 --> 01:38:35,966
Plant the landmine!

1278
01:38:57,606 --> 01:38:59,246
Hey, don't take the car down
that dirt road. Stop right here.

1279
01:39:04,566 --> 01:39:05,926
The car is here, but there's no driver.

1280
01:39:06,046 --> 01:39:08,286
Hey! Uncle seems
to be somewhere inside!

1281
01:39:08,686 --> 01:39:11,006
At this hour, on this bumpy road,

1282
01:39:11,086 --> 01:39:12,286
all these jerks
won't be good for Bharathi.

1283
01:39:12,486 --> 01:39:13,366
You guys take the main road.

1284
01:39:13,606 --> 01:39:14,486
I'll catch up.

1285
01:39:15,686 --> 01:39:16,526
All right.

1286
01:39:17,046 --> 01:39:17,966
- Be careful.
- Alright.

1287
01:39:29,686 --> 01:39:31,286
Brother, he's coming alone.

1288
01:39:41,606 --> 01:39:42,886
Why is he coming alone?

1289
01:40:57,286 --> 01:40:59,526
Uncle's laying an ambush
behind that banyan tree!

1290
01:41:04,646 --> 01:41:06,926
Brother Raghava Reddy is
guarding the bypass!

1291
01:41:11,526 --> 01:41:14,086
Damodhar Uncle's hiding in
the foxhole!

1292
01:41:17,566 --> 01:41:19,726
Tulasi's hiding across the culvert!

1293
01:41:22,766 --> 01:41:25,926
Thought you'd blow me up with a landmine?

1294
01:41:27,326 --> 01:41:28,966
Why would you go to such extremes?

1295
01:41:31,526 --> 01:41:32,966
What if your plan had worked,

1296
01:41:33,006 --> 01:41:34,606
and Lenin and Bharathi,
who were in the car, had died?

1297
01:41:36,366 --> 01:41:37,486
What would happen to me?

1298
01:41:40,286 --> 01:41:42,166
Watching your silly antics,

1299
01:41:42,886 --> 01:41:44,006
it's quite amusing, honestly.

1300
01:41:47,646 --> 01:41:49,886
In this joyful moment,
I feel like narrating you a story!

1301
01:41:52,886 --> 01:41:54,686
And don't think
it's a story from ages ago.

1302
01:41:57,326 --> 01:41:58,686
It's a story that took place

1303
01:41:58,726 --> 01:42:00,606
just ten minutes ago in our hospital.

1304
01:42:01,686 --> 01:42:02,846
Oh, Mother!

1305
01:42:11,646 --> 01:42:14,246
It breaks my heart to see you this way.
You remind me of someone.

1306
01:42:14,726 --> 01:42:15,566
He's from our village!

1307
01:42:16,966 --> 01:42:17,966
Do you know what he's like?

1308
01:42:18,526 --> 01:42:19,286
He keeps it all inside.

1309
01:42:21,486 --> 01:42:22,526
He hides it all…

1310
01:42:23,646 --> 01:42:25,046
until the time is right.

1311
01:42:27,406 --> 01:42:28,246
That's the kind of guy he is.

1312
01:42:28,766 --> 01:42:29,606
Three years ago…

1313
01:42:30,206 --> 01:42:31,526
when he came back
to the village for a festival,

1314
01:42:32,966 --> 01:42:33,966
he saw a girl.

1315
01:42:35,846 --> 01:42:37,086
The moment he laid eyes on her,

1316
01:42:37,366 --> 01:42:38,486
he completely lost his mind.

1317
01:43:00,326 --> 01:43:01,846
He, who used
to keep everything to himself,

1318
01:43:02,846 --> 01:43:05,366
started following her around,
even in Madras.

1319
01:43:34,366 --> 01:43:36,086
He quickly finished his medicine,

1320
01:43:36,726 --> 01:43:39,006
and returned,
determined to win her over.

1321
01:43:39,726 --> 01:43:40,686
But then, he hit a snag.

1322
01:43:41,246 --> 01:43:42,646
Neelakantam sent a message, son.

1323
01:43:42,686 --> 01:43:44,646
He wants to wed
his eldest daughter, Vaidehi, to you.

1324
01:43:44,966 --> 01:43:46,006
She's a wonderful girl!

1325
01:43:46,046 --> 01:43:47,206
She is entering your life.

1326
01:43:47,606 --> 01:43:48,966
I am so incredibly happy.

1327
01:43:49,886 --> 01:43:50,646
Mom.

1328
01:43:51,406 --> 01:43:52,726
Since the time is right, I'll tell you.

1329
01:43:55,646 --> 01:43:56,646
I don't want this marriage.

1330
01:43:58,566 --> 01:43:59,326
Why?

1331
01:43:59,966 --> 01:44:01,286
Are you in love with someone?

1332
01:44:01,846 --> 01:44:02,646
Yes, Mom.

1333
01:44:03,766 --> 01:44:05,046
I am in love with Bharathi!

1334
01:44:07,326 --> 01:44:08,166
Alright then.

1335
01:44:08,566 --> 01:44:09,366
Let's talk with Bharathi's family.

1336
01:44:09,686 --> 01:44:10,566
Worst case?

1337
01:44:10,646 --> 01:44:11,886
We wait until the elder sister
gets married.

1338
01:44:12,006 --> 01:44:13,526
- I'll talk to them!
- There is no chance for that.

1339
01:44:14,366 --> 01:44:15,726
Vaidehi is in love with me.

1340
01:44:24,926 --> 01:44:26,166
I want to marry Vasanth.

1341
01:44:28,846 --> 01:44:30,086
Now, if I reject this marriage,

1342
01:44:31,646 --> 01:44:33,926
Bharathi will find out that
Vaidehi was in love with me.

1343
01:44:34,406 --> 01:44:35,566
If that happens…

1344
01:44:36,526 --> 01:44:38,286
I can never be a part of Bharathi's life.

1345
01:44:39,286 --> 01:44:40,406
I've thought this through, Mom.

1346
01:44:41,526 --> 01:44:42,926
Just like Jayanthi has only one son,

1347
01:44:45,366 --> 01:44:47,326
what if Neelakantam
has only one son-in-law?

1348
01:44:49,766 --> 01:44:50,606
Son!

1349
01:44:52,366 --> 01:44:53,206
Mom.

1350
01:44:53,646 --> 01:44:55,526
I've never asked you
for anything since childhood!

1351
01:44:56,246 --> 01:44:57,006
Except for this.

1352
01:44:57,886 --> 01:44:58,646
Please, Mom.

1353
01:45:04,406 --> 01:45:05,726
I'll take care of everything else.

1354
01:45:06,726 --> 01:45:07,646
Just do as I say.

1355
01:45:14,286 --> 01:45:15,086
Vaidehi.

1356
01:45:15,646 --> 01:45:16,646
Did you tell anyone else

1357
01:45:17,166 --> 01:45:18,726
besides this tree that you love me?

1358
01:45:19,486 --> 01:45:20,286
No, Vasanth.

1359
01:45:20,886 --> 01:45:21,926
How did you know?

1360
01:45:22,886 --> 01:45:24,006
I need to meet you in private.

1361
01:45:24,486 --> 01:45:26,286
Shall we? Don't tell anyone.

1362
01:45:27,046 --> 01:45:27,886
Okay.

1363
01:45:38,726 --> 01:45:39,566
Govindu…

1364
01:45:39,966 --> 01:45:40,726
This letter…

1365
01:45:41,526 --> 01:45:42,646
must be placed in Vaidehi's room.

1366
01:45:42,926 --> 01:45:43,686
Okay, sister.

1367
01:46:00,326 --> 01:46:05,006
I thought my plan would win her over,

1368
01:46:05,926 --> 01:46:08,526
but she made me a laughing stock.

1369
01:46:09,286 --> 01:46:11,086
My heart beats for him, Vasanth.

1370
01:46:12,926 --> 01:46:13,926
But it doesn't matter.

1371
01:46:15,286 --> 01:46:17,686
If you want to marry me regardless,
it's up to you.

1372
01:46:19,246 --> 01:46:22,206
Seeing everyone laugh at
my situation was humiliating.

1373
01:46:23,246 --> 01:46:24,086
I felt like crying.

1374
01:46:24,686 --> 01:46:25,726
I was so mad,

1375
01:46:25,766 --> 01:46:27,246
I wanted to kill her on the spot.

1376
01:46:30,006 --> 01:46:32,006
So, what did I do?

1377
01:46:37,726 --> 01:46:42,166
I handed her to my friend,
whom she loved.

1378
01:46:42,366 --> 01:46:44,526
Just as she humiliated me
in front of everyone

1379
01:46:44,606 --> 01:46:46,286
and ruined my happiest day,

1380
01:46:46,646 --> 01:46:49,966
I decided to take revenge
on her happiest day.

1381
01:46:52,486 --> 01:46:55,086
With the Pushpa Yagam, the <i>Bharatham</i>
<i>Mitta</i> concludes this year.

1382
01:46:55,646 --> 01:46:57,206
Her love story began there,

1383
01:46:57,846 --> 01:46:59,646
and it must end there.

1384
01:47:00,286 --> 01:47:01,966
That's why I postponed it a little.

1385
01:47:02,846 --> 01:47:06,206
Until I say, the sacrificial fire
must keep burning.

1386
01:47:09,286 --> 01:47:11,406
At last, the time has come
for my revenge.

1387
01:47:11,686 --> 01:47:14,046
This is the happiest moment of
our lives, Vasanth!

1388
01:47:14,526 --> 01:47:17,326
This is the day I've been waiting for!

1389
01:47:17,566 --> 01:47:18,326
You mean…

1390
01:47:18,966 --> 01:47:20,566
What will you do to Bharathi now?

1391
01:47:23,286 --> 01:47:24,326
What will I do?

1392
01:47:46,726 --> 01:47:49,246
How long did that girl suffer,
suffocating to death, brother?!

1393
01:47:50,886 --> 01:47:51,686
Just two minutes!

1394
01:47:54,046 --> 01:47:56,686
But I’ve been enduring that
exact same hell for a month!

1395
01:48:02,086 --> 01:48:03,686
At last, the God fulfilled my wish.

1396
01:48:05,766 --> 01:48:07,606
Now, all of you must stand by my side.

1397
01:48:09,846 --> 01:48:12,286
What will it take to end
your vengeance, brother?

1398
01:48:17,926 --> 01:48:19,046
Damodhar Uncle!

1399
01:48:20,366 --> 01:48:22,486
Seven weeks of bridal jewelry for Aunt!

1400
01:48:23,366 --> 01:48:24,646
Crafted from the finest pure gold!

1401
01:48:25,926 --> 01:48:26,886
Along with that…

1402
01:48:27,606 --> 01:48:30,006
All the land you can limp across
in a day will be yours!

1403
01:48:33,046 --> 01:48:34,046
Raghava Reddy brother!

1404
01:48:35,406 --> 01:48:38,646
I’ll put up a towering cutout of
you at <i>Bharatham Mitta.</i>

1405
01:48:40,966 --> 01:48:41,966
Most importantly…

1406
01:48:43,606 --> 01:48:46,086
I really believe my father's
death was an accident!

1407
01:48:49,966 --> 01:48:50,766
Ethirajulu!

1408
01:48:52,366 --> 01:48:54,526
I know you've been trying to kill me.

1409
01:48:55,526 --> 01:48:56,526
I know everything!

1410
01:49:02,646 --> 01:49:04,566
Even if my father didn't
see you as a brother,

1411
01:49:06,486 --> 01:49:07,966
I still honor you as my uncle.

1412
01:49:10,286 --> 01:49:12,526
I'm telling you this,
swearing on <i>Bharatham Mitta.</i>

1413
01:49:12,566 --> 01:49:15,606
I’ll make you the trustee and honor
you like <i>Dharma Raju</i> himself.

1414
01:49:19,526 --> 01:49:20,846
Think it over carefully!

1415
01:49:23,846 --> 01:49:26,766
From now on, you're either with me
or against me!

1416
01:49:29,366 --> 01:49:30,966
If you oppose me,

1417
01:49:32,966 --> 01:49:36,006
I’m taking ten of your heads with me!

1418
01:50:00,286 --> 01:50:01,206
Hey, Vasanth.

1419
01:50:01,926 --> 01:50:03,286
What exactly do you want?

1420
01:50:04,086 --> 01:50:06,246
The time has come to put out
the sacrificial fire.

1421
01:50:08,966 --> 01:50:11,526
We have to celebrate this
festival grandly this year!

1422
01:50:12,686 --> 01:50:13,926
To make that happen,

1423
01:50:14,886 --> 01:50:16,886
you must all stand by me!

1424
01:50:32,366 --> 01:50:33,606
At our <i>Bharatham Mitta,</i>

1425
01:50:34,846 --> 01:50:36,166
the most pivotal ritual,

1426
01:50:36,846 --> 01:50:37,846
is Pushpa Yagam.

1427
01:50:38,006 --> 01:50:39,966
Since the sacred fire went out yesterday

1428
01:50:40,086 --> 01:50:40,926
Today,

1429
01:50:41,286 --> 01:50:42,286
Goddess Draupadi

1430
01:50:42,646 --> 01:50:44,246
will step outside the inner sanctum,

1431
01:50:44,366 --> 01:50:46,046
be taken on a procession across villages,

1432
01:50:46,286 --> 01:50:47,366
and by the night…

1433
01:50:47,566 --> 01:50:48,646
she will return to the temple.

1434
01:50:48,726 --> 01:50:49,686
Until then,

1435
01:50:49,966 --> 01:50:51,966
these temple grounds shall remain sealed.

1436
01:50:56,526 --> 01:50:57,646
The next year,

1437
01:50:58,246 --> 01:50:59,966
you're Dharma Raju, Uncle.

1438
01:51:03,966 --> 01:51:06,886
They're coming out
for Goddess' chariot procession.

1439
01:51:09,966 --> 01:51:11,166
Get the plan started.

1440
01:51:26,966 --> 01:51:28,606
I wonder where sir is coming from.

1441
01:51:29,206 --> 01:51:31,966
The procession of Mother Draupadi.
I was closing the temple.

1442
01:51:32,646 --> 01:51:34,086
I won't be able to again anyways.

1443
01:51:35,286 --> 01:51:37,406
You know how sad I feel, my love?

1444
01:51:38,286 --> 01:51:39,646
You don't have to feel that sad.

1445
01:51:40,046 --> 01:51:42,046
The village will look after Her.

1446
01:51:42,726 --> 01:51:44,926
But there's no one to look after me.

1447
01:51:46,286 --> 01:51:47,726
Why would you say that, my love?

1448
01:51:48,886 --> 01:51:49,966
It's a fact.

1449
01:51:51,006 --> 01:51:53,966
You told me you would take me to a movie.

1450
01:51:54,366 --> 01:51:57,166
Go and fresh up. I'll prepare dinner.

1451
01:52:06,646 --> 01:52:08,046
♪ If you stand far away from me ♪

1452
01:52:08,646 --> 01:52:10,366
♪ My whole body burns with longing ♪

1453
01:52:10,686 --> 01:52:14,286
♪ Come a little closer, my love ♪

1454
01:52:15,086 --> 01:52:16,926
♪ Don't be upset with me ♪

1455
01:52:17,286 --> 01:52:19,046
♪ And add this heavy burden to my heart ♪

1456
01:52:19,326 --> 01:52:22,846
♪ Come quietly to my embrace, my love ♪

1457
01:52:24,006 --> 01:52:25,846
Hey, my Bharathi smiled.

1458
01:52:28,766 --> 01:52:32,846
♪ There is no need for anyone else
Between you and me ♪

1459
01:52:32,926 --> 01:52:36,846
♪ Just the two of us
We are our own little world! ♪

1460
01:52:37,286 --> 01:52:41,286
♪ No more hiding behind
Shyness or secrets ♪

1461
01:52:41,406 --> 01:52:44,926
♪ Let us beautifully build
A happy home together ♪

1462
01:52:45,526 --> 01:52:50,286
♪ Like a joyful little child
I will sleep peacefully in your lap ♪

1463
01:52:53,966 --> 01:52:59,006
♪ If time passes just like this
I ask for nothing more ♪

1464
01:53:02,566 --> 01:53:05,286
♪ Though I'm surrounded with people
I'm a lonely man ♪

1465
01:53:05,406 --> 01:53:07,766
♪ You are my everything ♪

1466
01:53:11,046 --> 01:53:14,006
♪ Without you, I am no longer myself ♪

1467
01:53:14,046 --> 01:53:16,966
♪ I am who I am, only because of you! ♪

1468
01:53:21,606 --> 01:53:22,686
I won't forget, my love.

1469
01:53:23,606 --> 01:53:24,886
I'll take you to movie, tomorrow.

1470
01:53:39,646 --> 01:53:41,086
I'm MLA Raghava Reddy.

1471
01:53:41,686 --> 01:53:43,646
No matter what happens
at Ramapuram's fair today,

1472
01:53:43,926 --> 01:53:46,086
not a single cop should go there.

1473
01:53:51,166 --> 01:53:51,966
- Dude!
- Yes!

1474
01:53:52,006 --> 01:53:53,646
- Isn't that Ranganna?
- Yes!

1475
01:53:53,966 --> 01:53:55,966
The village festival is tonight,
so where are they heading?

1476
