Please, I'm begging you.

1612
02:05:55,086 --> 02:05:57,606
Let Bharathi go. She's my life.

1613
02:05:59,766 --> 02:06:00,886
Bharathi, my love!

1614
02:06:01,726 --> 02:06:02,926
You'll be fine.

1615
02:06:03,646 --> 02:06:04,646
You'll be fine!

1616
02:06:13,606 --> 02:06:16,086
Hey. Hey.

1617
02:06:17,966 --> 02:06:19,086
Hey, Vasanth!

1618
02:06:19,606 --> 02:06:21,526
Let Bharathi go.
What did she do to you?

1619
02:06:21,646 --> 02:06:23,526
