Two people died that day.

1647
02:09:21,206 --> 02:09:22,166
One was Bharathi…

1648
02:09:24,366 --> 02:09:25,206
and the other was

1649
02:09:28,606 --> 02:09:29,366
your father.

1650
02:09:37,966 --> 02:09:41,566
My Bharathi told me
her heart beats for you.

1651
02:09:42,246 --> 02:09:44,326
Then how could I ever kill

1652
02:09:44,966 --> 02:09:46,646
my best friend who owns that heart?

1653
02:09:47,926 --> 02:09:51,006
That's why I made you kill her.

1654
02:09:57,966 --> 02:09:58,886
Lenin!

1655
02:10:00,046 --> 02:10:01,846
I am not angry with you at all.

1656
02:10:04,286 --> 02:10:07,086
But I'm only furious about Bharathi.

1657
02:10:08,646 --> 02:10:10,286
Furious that she was never mine.

1658
02:10:11,486 --> 02:10:12,966
