- I misunderstood you.
- Get up.

1664
02:10:33,006 --> 02:10:33,846
Get up.

1665
02:10:41,086 --> 02:10:42,326
Kill him, dude.
Kill him.

1666
02:10:42,686 --> 02:10:44,646
Kill them as I make the count.

1667
