You leave, Delhi.

1675
02:11:04,966 --> 02:11:05,726
Go.

1676
02:12:34,406 --> 02:12:35,886
Where the hell is Vasanth?

1677
02:13:06,286 --> 02:13:07,326
Hey!

1678
02:13:08,246 --> 02:13:09,526
Chop him to pieces!

1679
02:13:26,486 --> 02:13:28,286
Where is Vasanth?

1680
02:13:44,566 --> 02:13:45,326
What is this, Mom?

1681
02:13:46,086 --> 02:13:47,966
You called your son over to kill me?

1682
02:13:49,606 --> 02:13:50,846
You didn't even inform me beforehand.

1683
02:13:51,886 --> 02:13:52,726
Don't be afraid.

1684
02:13:53,286 --> 02:13:55,206
I won't kill him with my hands.

1685
02:13:56,326 --> 02:13:57,606
We can't kill him anyway.

1686
02:13:59,766 --> 02:14:00,686
Because…

1687
