to strike him to his face.

1689
02:14:12,846 --> 02:14:14,966
People do mistakes to survive.

1690
02:14:15,526 --> 02:14:16,886
But we committed sins.

1691
02:14:18,166 --> 02:14:20,646
We killed our beloved Vaidehi.

1692
02:14:25,606 --> 02:14:29,766
We smeared <i>Bharatham Mitta</i> with blood
and turned it into a cremation ground.

1693
02:14:33,086 --> 02:14:35,286
I carried the burden for these people,

1694
02:14:36,646 --> 02:14:38,726
only to become the cause of their tears.

1695
02:14:43,846 --> 02:14:44,646
That's why,

1696
02:14:45,926 --> 02:14:47,886
his friendship turned into enmity.

1697
02:14:48,926 --> 02:14:50,926
What you believed to be love
became a calamity.

1698
02:14:54,006 --> 02:14:57,086
While her love for the husband
made Gandhaari blind,

1699
02:15:00,926 --> 02:15:01,726
Motherly love…

1700
02:15:03,926 --> 02:15:05,206
made me blind to the truth

1701
02:15:06,526 --> 02:15:08,086
and drove me to kill a woman.

1702
02:15:14,046 --> 02:15:15,486
I died that day itself.

1703
02:15:23,526 --> 02:15:25,926
That's why I went over to see him.

1704
02:15:29,006 --> 02:15:30,366
Forgive me, son.

1705
02:15:35,926 --> 02:15:37,886
The village thrived
as long as his love lived.

1706
02:15:38,526 --> 02:15:39,646
Not anymore.

1707
02:15:40,366 --> 02:15:42,246
My son's revenge
brought <i>Bharatham Mitta</i> to an end,

1708
02:15:43,646 --> 02:15:45,926
