<i>♪ Rakasikara ♪</i>

1722
02:17:33,966 --> 02:17:35,166
<i>♪ Rakasikara ♪</i>

1723
02:18:37,246 --> 02:18:39,846
Lenin's eyes were injured at the festival

1724
02:18:40,286 --> 02:18:41,646
