<i>♪ Victory and auspiciousness</i>
<i>Eternal joy and blessings! ♪</i>

1770
02:23:42,166 --> 02:23:45,246
<i>♪ For the long-lived</i>
<i>And blessed Alamelu Mangamma ♪</i>

1771
02:23:45,646 --> 02:23:48,646
<i>♪ And the ever-smiling Lord Seenayya ♪</i>

1772
02:23:49,206 --> 02:23:52,286
<i>♪ This beautiful wedding</i>
<i>Unfolding before us ♪</i>

1773
02:23:52,646 --> 02:23:55,966
<i>♪ Is a magnificent celebration</i>
<i>For the entire world! ♪</i>

1774
02:23:56,166 --> 02:23:59,086
<i>♪ Oh! The grand wedding of Seenayya ♪</i>

1775
02:23:59,606 --> 02:24:02,966
<i>♪ The glorious celebration</i>
<i>Of Alamelu Mangamma! ♪</i>

1776
02:24:09,966 --> 02:24:13,086
<i>♪ Look at this handsome groom, oh my! ♪</i>

1777
02:24:16,846 --> 02:24:19,926
<i>♪ He is hard to find, oh yes! ♪</i>

1778
02:24:23,966 --> 02:24:26,926
<i>♪ He is a man whose word never wavers ♪</i>

1779
02:24:30,726 --> 02:24:33,726
<i>♪ Born of fierce and noble blood ♪</i>

1780
02:24:37,206 --> 02:24:40,646
<i>♪ This bride is the very moon on earth ♪</i>

1781
02:24:41,286 --> 02:24:43,966
<i>♪ She is the divine abode of all virtues ♪</i>

1782
02:24:44,086 --> 02:24:48,086
<i>♪ May this beautiful couple</i>
<i>Flourish for eternity! ♪</i>

1783
02:24:51,646 --> 02:24:54,686
<i>♪ Oh! The grand wedding of Seenayya ♪</i>

1784
02:24:55,206 --> 02:24:58,966
<i>♪ The glorious celebration</i>
<i>Of Alamelu Mangamma! ♪</i>

1785
02:25:06,246 --> 02:25:08,486
<i>♪ I swear upon the leaves</i>
